1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 12=

10
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:06,180
Are they

11
00:01:07,550 --> 00:01:08,420
human or ghosts?

12
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:12,900
They

13
00:01:14,290 --> 00:01:15,470
are my secret.

14
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:18,990
They are poison soldiers,
more loyal than any man,

15
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:20,590
more vicious than any ghost,

16
00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:22,060
unafraid of pain

17
00:01:23,990 --> 00:01:25,660
and unafraid of death.

18
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:26,950
Poison soldiers?

19
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:31,030
This... This is terrifying.

20
00:01:35,390 --> 00:01:36,390
Don't be afraid, my dear.

21
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:38,300
When war comes,

22
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:41,670
I'll let you see for yourself

23
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:44,180
how they crush the enemy camp

24
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:46,070
and conquer all before them.

25
00:01:47,670 --> 00:01:48,620
When that day comes,

26
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:49,900
I, Xiao Jing,

27
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,980
will be the only
undefeated general in the world.

28
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:54,430
The historians

29
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:57,430
will write of my triumphs.

30
00:01:58,710 --> 00:02:02,030
(Xiao Jing, you're a monster.)

31
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:05,620
Medical Officer Gu, this way, please.

32
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:09,310
Her Highness has been waiting
for you since early this morning.

33
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:11,700
Thank you, Madam Rong.

34
00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:15,110
You're unusually courteous today.

35
00:02:16,230 --> 00:02:17,540
You're too kind, Medical Officer Gu.

36
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:20,900
You're in Her Highness's
good graces, after all.

37
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,390
This way, please.

38
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:31,260
Cui Rongyin has discovered
that His Majesty is a woman.

39
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:33,540
This matter

40
00:02:34,950 --> 00:02:36,390
must be handled by you.

41
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,230
His Majesty means

42
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:40,310
for me to use
the golden needle technique

43
00:02:40,670 --> 00:02:41,980
to kill without leaving a trace?

44
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:47,620
Your Highness!

45
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:50,030
Seize her!

46
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,590
What are you doing?

47
00:02:55,390 --> 00:02:55,900
Your Highness!

48
00:02:58,830 --> 00:03:02,310
Gu Hanyi attempted
to murder the Noble Consort.

49
00:03:03,230 --> 00:03:03,830
Take her away.

50
00:03:04,670 --> 00:03:05,910
She will await judgment.

51
00:03:06,830 --> 00:03:08,020
We need to save Her Highness first!

52
00:03:08,070 --> 00:03:08,740
Your Highness!

53
00:03:09,070 --> 00:03:09,790
Your Highness!

54
00:03:10,670 --> 00:03:11,300
Your Highness!

55
00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:33,860
Madam Rong.

56
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:38,700
Gu Hanyi.

57
00:03:39,950 --> 00:03:41,630
The rules of this
torture chamber are simple.

58
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:45,190
Until you confess
and sign your statement,

59
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:47,980
the torture will not stop.

60
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:52,300
I'll give you one last chance.

61
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,260
Admit that you used your golden needles

62
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:57,740
to harm the Noble Consort,

63
00:03:59,110 --> 00:04:00,950
and I'll make your death quick.

64
00:04:01,950 --> 00:04:03,580
(It seems Noble Consort Cui
is in no real danger.)

65
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,140
(She wants to use this chance
to have me sentenced to death.)

66
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:09,790
(Then I'll play along
and see this through.)

67
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:12,630
I never tried to harm the Noble Consort.

68
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,800
How can I confess
to something I didn't do?

69
00:04:17,110 --> 00:04:18,830
Still refusing to yield, I see.

70
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:22,510
Her Highness lost consciousness

71
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:24,350
right after you treated her
with your needles.

72
00:04:25,420 --> 00:04:27,420
There are witnesses
and evidence against you.

73
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:30,460
You cannot talk your way out of this.

74
00:04:38,420 --> 00:04:39,300
A physician's needles

75
00:04:40,230 --> 00:04:40,950
can save lives,

76
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:42,580
but they can also kill.

77
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:44,790
But my needles

78
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:48,830
have never drawn the blood
of an innocent person.

79
00:04:51,580 --> 00:04:52,830
You go to such lengths to frame me.

80
00:04:54,950 --> 00:04:55,980
What are you afraid of?

81
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:01,390
Afraid?

82
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,510
You're hardly worth fearing.

83
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,110
Beat her.

84
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:14,830
Keep beating her until she confesses.

85
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:15,260
Yes.

86
00:05:20,450 --> 00:05:21,680
Let's see how long
you can keep defying us.

87
00:05:29,460 --> 00:05:31,580
Does Your Majesty know
that Hanyi has been falsely accused?

88
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,460
Her life is at stake.

89
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,310
I know how much
you care for your apprentice.

90
00:05:36,950 --> 00:05:37,700
But in this case,

91
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:39,140
both the witnesses and the evidence

92
00:05:39,310 --> 00:05:40,830
weigh heavily against Gu Hanyi.

93
00:05:41,990 --> 00:05:42,900
Madam Rong testified

94
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:46,100
that she saw Gu Hanyi use her
golden needles to harm the Noble Consort,

95
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:47,390
causing Her Highness
to lose consciousness.

96
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:50,900
I don't want to believe it either.

97
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:52,390
If Your Majesty
believes Hanyi is innocent,

98
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:55,460
then she is innocent.

99
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:06,070
Wake up.

100
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:20,830
Confess, Gu Hanyi.

101
00:06:21,950 --> 00:06:22,660
In here,

102
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:25,870
your life is not yours to decide.

103
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:31,580
Crushing you

104
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:36,830
would be easier than crushing an ant.

105
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:41,510
Kill me if you want.

106
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:43,430
If you don't,

107
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:45,630
I'll become

108
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:48,870
a thorn in your side
that you'll never be rid of.

109
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:55,700
You have a death wish.

110
00:06:58,020 --> 00:06:58,950
Keep beating her.

111
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:03,070
Don't stop until she confesses!

112
00:07:03,550 --> 00:07:03,990
Yes.

113
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:06,190
(What you have done to me today,)

114
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:10,390
(I will repay a thousandfold someday.)

115
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:11,900
Very well.

116
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:16,340
I will speak to Cui Rongyin myself.

117
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,830
If Gu Hanyi has truly been wronged,

118
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:21,550
I will not spare the real culprit.

119
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:30,550
You dare block His Majesty's path?

120
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,310
Such insolence!

121
00:07:32,550 --> 00:07:33,990
Which palace do you serve in?

122
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:35,190
State your name.

123
00:07:35,700 --> 00:07:36,390
Your Majesty.

124
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:38,220
Medical Officer Gu is innocent.

125
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:39,220
I...

126
00:07:39,550 --> 00:07:40,990
I saw it with my own eyes.

127
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:42,990
Raise your head and speak.

128
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:46,510
I am Chuchu.

129
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:49,750
I do menial cleaning work
in Noble Consort Cui's palace.

130
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:51,830
The day Her Highness fell ill,

131
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:53,630
I saw Madam Rong.

132
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:55,390
When no one was around,

133
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:57,660
she slipped a black pill

134
00:07:58,460 --> 00:08:00,660
into the flower tea
Her Highness usually drinks.

135
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:01,550
Did you see clearly?

136
00:08:02,090 --> 00:08:03,240
Are you certain it was Madam Rong?

137
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:04,870
Absolutely.

138
00:08:05,340 --> 00:08:06,550
It was the day before yesterday at noon,

139
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:07,580
in the small tea room.

140
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:09,660
Madam Rong was acting suspiciously.

141
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:11,830
After putting in the pill,
she kept looking around

142
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:13,260
for fear someone might see her.

143
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,090
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

144
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:36,460
Your Majesty.

145
00:08:39,190 --> 00:08:40,310
My beloved consort, you have suffered.

146
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,220
Fortunately,
the true culprit behind this

147
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,580
has been caught.

148
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:46,460
Your Majesty,

149
00:08:47,310 --> 00:08:49,550
who was trying to harm me?

150
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:53,700
It was the person you trusted most,

151
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:55,100
Madam Rong.

152
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:56,700
She has confessed.

153
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:59,100
She admitted to poisoning you

154
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,460
and framing Gu Hanyi.

155
00:09:01,870 --> 00:09:02,750
Madam Rong?

156
00:09:03,070 --> 00:09:04,870
Why would she...

157
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:08,550
She said

158
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:11,660
you ordered her to do it.

159
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:18,140
Naturally, I do not believe her.

160
00:09:19,070 --> 00:09:20,660
You are gentle and kind.

161
00:09:20,950 --> 00:09:22,900
You would never do anything so vile.

162
00:09:24,190 --> 00:09:25,340
But I do not understand

163
00:09:25,830 --> 00:09:27,430
why she would implicate you.

164
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:32,340
Can you explain this to me?

165
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:41,220
Greetings, Mr. Xie.

166
00:09:41,740 --> 00:09:44,430
May I ask why

167
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:45,790
you summoned me here?

168
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:54,860
You know who I am?

169
00:09:55,620 --> 00:09:57,030
You must be joking, Mr. Xie.

170
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:59,700
How could I not recognize you?

171
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:03,980
You are His Majesty's savior.

172
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:05,500
Madam Rong.

173
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:08,430
The Noble Consort
has regained consciousness,

174
00:10:08,950 --> 00:10:11,910
and she has confessed.

175
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,220
Confessed?

176
00:10:15,830 --> 00:10:18,310
Her Highness is of such noble standing.

177
00:10:19,030 --> 00:10:20,550
What could she possibly
have to confess to?

178
00:10:21,790 --> 00:10:23,070
Mr. Xie,

179
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,270
I don't understand

180
00:10:25,460 --> 00:10:26,620
what you mean.

181
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:30,830
She admitted that Gu Hanyi
is a gifted physician and a great beauty,

182
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,830
and has won His Majesty's favor.

183
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,860
Fearing that Gu Hanyi
would threaten her position,

184
00:10:35,070 --> 00:10:35,700
she

185
00:10:36,150 --> 00:10:39,100
ordered you to poison her

186
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,220
and frame Gu Hanyi.

187
00:10:42,070 --> 00:10:44,310
No. That's impossible.

188
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:46,860
Why would Her Highness confess?

189
00:10:51,190 --> 00:10:52,860
Why would she confess?

190
00:10:53,950 --> 00:10:54,860
So

191
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:57,150
you acted entirely on your own

192
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:59,700
and were not acting
on the Noble Consort's orders.

193
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:02,580
You took matters into your own hands

194
00:11:03,430 --> 00:11:05,070
and acted without authorization.

195
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,150
The day before yesterday at noon,

196
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:09,950
in the small tea room,

197
00:11:10,220 --> 00:11:11,580
I saw Madam Rong with my own eyes

198
00:11:11,620 --> 00:11:12,740
put a black pill

199
00:11:12,790 --> 00:11:14,620
into the Noble Consort's flower tea.

200
00:11:15,740 --> 00:11:16,580
You wretched maid!

201
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:17,830
How dare you slander me!

202
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:23,340
I demand to see the Noble Consort.

203
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:26,980
Her Highness
will see justice done for me.

204
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:31,980
I knew

205
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:33,910
my beloved consort was kindhearted

206
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:35,070
and knew right from wrong.

207
00:11:36,950 --> 00:11:40,310
This must have been that wicked servant
betraying her mistress

208
00:11:41,310 --> 00:11:42,380
and framing Gu Hanyi.

209
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:45,910
Rest and recover.

210
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,070
As for this matter,

211
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,550
I will see that justice is done.

212
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,620
Pass down my decree.

213
00:11:59,270 --> 00:11:59,860
Yes.

214
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:00,860
The wicked servant Rong

215
00:12:00,910 --> 00:12:01,980
attempted to murder her mistress

216
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:03,340
and framed another.

217
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:05,060
Her crimes are unforgivable.

218
00:12:06,220 --> 00:12:07,220
Beat her to death.

219
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:09,670
As Your Majesty commands.

220
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:25,310
(Will I)

221
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:27,580
(be next?)

222
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:44,140
(Ministry of Justice)

223
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:22,830
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

224
00:13:23,590 --> 00:13:26,530
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

225
00:13:27,190 --> 00:13:30,010
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

226
00:13:30,860 --> 00:13:33,850
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

227
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:38,020
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

228
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:41,650
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

229
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:48,480
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

230
00:13:49,270 --> 00:13:56,360
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

231
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:06,710
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

232
00:14:07,010 --> 00:14:08,820
♪I stand here today♪

233
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:13,470
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

234
00:14:13,470 --> 00:14:20,960
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

235
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,890
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

236
00:14:22,890 --> 00:14:25,290
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

237
00:14:25,730 --> 00:14:32,580
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
